/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 799 0 R
/E (In this Arduino program, a push button is connected to pin 5 \(BUTTON_PIN\) and a TM1637 4-digit display is connected to pins 8 \(CLK\) and 9 \(DIO\). The display shows the number of button presses.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
469 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 800 0 R
